WEBVTT

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:29.590
The true way is along a rope

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:35.640
that is not spanned high in the air,

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:38.270
but only just above the ground.

00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:43.690
It seems intended more to cause stumbling,

00:00:43.690 --> 00:00:48.190
rather than to be walked upon.

00:00:53.200 --> 00:01:01.040
A COUNTRY DOCTOR

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:13.720
<i>I was at a complete loss.</i>

00:01:17.350 --> 00:01:19.600
Actually,

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:25.400
I should have headed out right away.

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:36.990
In a small village ten miles away,

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:42.540
a seriously ill patient was waiting for my arrival.

00:02:04.150 --> 00:02:06.110
Let us use your horse, please.

00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:16.070
Will you please?

00:03:09.380 --> 00:03:12.510
Shall I harness up?

00:03:21.350 --> 00:03:27.190
Sometimes you never know what's under your very own roof.

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:38.780
Hey, Brother. Hey, Sister.

00:04:19.990 --> 00:04:22.030
Help him out.

00:04:34.630 --> 00:04:36.590
You beast.

00:04:36.590 --> 00:04:38.760
Do you want a flogging?

00:04:40.470 --> 00:04:45.140
<i>I haven't the slightest idea who this man is.</i>

00:04:45.140 --> 00:04:48.100
<i>He's a complete stranger.</i>

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:52.400
<i>Yet he was the only person</i>

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:56.110
<i>who was willing to help me</i>

00:04:56.110 --> 00:04:58.990
<i>when no one else would.</i>

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:01.660
Hop in.

00:05:14.590 --> 00:05:17.130
But I'll take the reins.

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:20.590
You don't know how to get there.

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:22.130
Exactly.

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:24.350
I wasn't going to come along.

00:05:24.350 --> 00:05:27.100
I'll stay here with Rosa.

00:05:27.100 --> 00:05:28.560
No!

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:38.110
No. You're coming with me.

00:05:38.610 --> 00:05:41.530
If you don't go,

00:05:41.530 --> 00:05:44.070
neither will I,

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:46.580
despite the urgency of the matter.

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:51.120
There's no way in the world

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:55.920
I will give up the girl in exchange for your horses.

00:05:56.670 --> 00:05:57.880
Giddy up!

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:16.080
Doctor.

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:18.750
Please let me die.

00:07:39.690 --> 00:07:43.900
<i>In a desperate moment like this,</i>

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:47.950
<i>the gods lend a helping hand.</i>

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:52.200
<i>They sent me a horse I needed for traveling,</i>

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:56.040
<i>and another for the urgency of the matter at hand.</i>

00:07:57.000 --> 00:08:01.590
<i>Not to mention the groom with whom I don't know what to do.</i>

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:22.440
<i>I must get back.</i>

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:56.600
<i>Just as I suspected.</i>

00:08:57.310 --> 00:08:59.730
He is not sick.

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:05.860
Drinking too much of his mother's coffee

00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:12.320
does not help his circulation, but otherwise he's healthy.

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:14.870
The truth is

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:19.790
it would be best to just shove him out of bed.

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:21.920
However,

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:27.050
I'm not here to make a difference in the world.

00:09:27.340 --> 00:09:32.510
So, I'll just leave my patient lying in bed.

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:38.100
I'm just a doctor hired by village officials

00:09:38.850 --> 00:09:44.400
who more than fulfills his duties and responsibilities.

00:09:46.110 --> 00:09:50.240
<i>Despite the minimal salary,</i>

00:09:50.240 --> 00:09:55.160
<i>I go the extra mile for poor patients.</i>

00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:58.540
<i>Just like this young patient of mine,</i>

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:02.790
<i>I wish I could die, too.</i>

00:10:03.460 --> 00:10:07.040
<i>In an endless winter just like this,</i>

00:10:07.630 --> 00:10:11.380
<i>what am I supposed to do?</i>

00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:23.440
<i>I was lucky that I found not pigs,</i>

00:10:23.440 --> 00:10:28.520
<i>but horses in the pig stall.</i>

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:32.360
<i>I guess it was meant to be.</i>

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:39.200
<i>These people can't imagine my ordeals.</i>

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:43.370
<i>Even if they did, they wouldn't believe it.</i>

00:10:44.290 --> 00:10:47.630
<i>It's easy to write prescriptions for them,</i>

00:10:47.630 --> 00:10:51.960
<i>but to really connect with them?</i>

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:57.470
All the same, my work here is done.

00:10:58.890 --> 00:11:01.270
Once again,

00:11:01.270 --> 00:11:04.890
my visit was unnecessary.

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:10.900
Sadly, this is all too familiar to me.

00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:13.650
<i>The villagers here</i>

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:17.740
<i>abuse the emergency night bell.</i>

00:11:18.410 --> 00:11:23.870
<i>Maybe they are all in this together to make me suffer.</i>

00:11:37.890 --> 00:11:40.890
Now I'm busy

00:11:40.890 --> 00:11:45.100
trying to come up with an excuse to leave.

00:11:45.810 --> 00:11:47.520
If I stay any longer

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:51.940
I'm afraid I can't hold back

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:55.950
the urge to become violent with this moronic family.

00:12:00.620 --> 00:12:03.700
<i>What these people want from me</i>

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:07.040
<i>is beyond my comprehension.</i>

00:12:10.420 --> 00:12:12.290
<i>But could it be possible</i>

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:16.260
<i>that the young boy is actually sick?</i>

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:25.770
<i>I can hear both horses neighing.</i>

00:12:25.770 --> 00:12:29.810
<i>Perhaps they received some kind of heavenly order</i>

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:33.730
<i>to make the examination go smoothly.</i>

00:12:39.660 --> 00:12:41.490
Indeed,

00:12:41.490 --> 00:12:44.490
the young boy is ill.

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:53.420
Poor boy,

00:12:53.420 --> 00:12:56.630
there's nothing I can do for you.

00:12:56.630 --> 00:13:00.510
I now see this grave wound on your body.

00:13:01.140 --> 00:13:04.890
Your life will soon end

00:13:04.890 --> 00:13:08.020
and the flower on your side will bloom.

00:13:21.950 --> 00:13:24.120
Will you save me?

00:13:25.830 --> 00:13:27.750
Here I am.

00:13:27.750 --> 00:13:29.500
Do as you wish.

00:13:30.250 --> 00:13:33.210
What more do you want from me?

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:38.210
I'm only a village doctor, and my maid was

00:13:39.260 --> 00:13:42.260
just robbed of her innocence.

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:53.770
<i>Let's take his clothes off</i>

00:13:54.480 --> 00:14:00.190
<i>Then he'll have to cure the boy</i>

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:08.490
<i>If he can't cure the boy</i>

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:11.500
<i>Let's just kill the doctor</i>

00:14:12.040 --> 00:14:15.540
<i>He's only a doctor</i>

00:14:38.400 --> 00:14:39.650
Listen.

00:14:40.110 --> 00:14:44.200
I don't really trust you as a doctor, you know?

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:47.870
You were just shaken out of somewhere else.

00:14:47.870 --> 00:14:51.700
You didn't even come on your own feet.

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:54.250
And instead of helping me,

00:14:54.250 --> 00:14:57.630
you take up space in my deathbed.

00:14:58.130 --> 00:15:01.590
I wish I could rip your eyeballs out.

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:05.260
I have no excuse to offer.

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:07.930
Still, I am your doctor.

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:11.520
What do you think I'm supposed to do?

00:15:12.270 --> 00:15:15.270
Things are not easy for me, either.

00:15:15.980 --> 00:15:20.570
Am I supposed to be satisfied with what you just said?

00:15:20.570 --> 00:15:25.070
I know. I should be content with what I'm given.

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:28.910
I was born with this beautiful wound.

00:15:28.910 --> 00:15:31.950
It's my one and only treasure.

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:34.750
My young friend,

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:37.620
your weakness

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:40.710
is that you have such a narrow perspective.

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:42.710
In my days,

00:15:42.710 --> 00:15:47.470
I've seen all sorts of sick people.

00:15:47.470 --> 00:15:50.300
Believe me when I say this.

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:54.680
Your wound is not so bad.

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:59.310
Two deep ax blows, right?

00:15:59.860 --> 00:16:04.900
Many people in the forest leave their sides exposed,

00:16:05.490 --> 00:16:08.700
not hearing the sound of the ax,

00:16:08.700 --> 00:16:12.740
nor do they realize

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:15.540
that it's coming closer to them.

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:21.250
Is it really like that

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:24.960
or do you think you can trick me because I'm feverish?

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:27.930
It's the truth.

00:16:27.930 --> 00:16:31.760
Take with you the solemn oath of a medical functionary,

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:34.890
when you cross to the other side.

00:16:40.150 --> 00:16:45.440
It's my turn to find a way to get out of here.

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:33.070
Giddy up!

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:39.040
<i>Rejoice, my dear patients</i>

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:41.580
<i>The children have a new song to sing,</i>

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:45.210
<i>The doctor lay in bed next to you</i>

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:45.210
<i>even though the words are wrong.</i>

00:17:55.600 --> 00:17:58.640
<i>I'd never gone home in this fashion.</i>
